 un roi imaginaire, d'Haendel, 

00:53:39.520 --> 00:53:42.560 size:59% position:29% line:95%
 Qui... "Ombra Mai Fu", 

00:53:42.720 --> 00:53:44.960 align:end position:100% line:95%
